@startuml
' arch-lens: type=component
' arch-lens: question=在单一 local-first 产品边界内，Skill、CLI、工作区、受管 PlantUML 与人类如何分工，Git 为何只在边界外？
title Local-first 职责与边界
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction

actor "人类审查者" as Reviewer
actor "AI Agent" as Agent

rectangle "Arch Lens local-first core" as Core {
  component "Arch Lens Skill\n语义、建模、视觉与实现审查" as Skill
  component "Deterministic CLI\ncontent digests、schema、PlantUML facts" as CLI
  artifact "Managed PlantUML\nlocal renderer" as PlantUML
  folder "Workspace .arch-lens/" as Workspace {
    file "principles.md" as Principles
    folder "diagrams/**/*.puml\ncanonical models" as Diagrams
    folder "changes/<id>/\nproposal、decisions、tasks、approval、verification" as Change
    folder "temporary rendered SVG\ncache only" as Rendered
  }
}

component "Repository CI/scripts\noptional and outside product contract" as RepoCI
component "Git\nnot read by CLI or Skill" as Git

Agent --> Skill : proposes and reviews
Reviewer --> Skill : approves design and completion
Skill --> CLI : requests deterministic facts
CLI --> Workspace : reads and writes protocol files
CLI --> PlantUML : renders candidate SVG
PlantUML --> Rendered : temporary visual review material
CLI --> CLI : computes baselineDigest、designDigest、completionDigest
Skill --> Diagrams : maintains candidate and approved content
Skill --> Change : records decisions and evidence
RepoCI --> Git : repo-only audit

note bottom of Git: Git 与提交身份不进入 CLI/Skill 的任何状态判断。
@enduml
